        "jsCode": "// === KOOCESTER HIRING BRAIN — PATH SPLITTER ===\n// Just splits the folder path into segments. \n// Native Google Drive nodes handle search/create.\n\nconst ROOT_FOLDER_ID = '14DbhhKSOogQsuE2-3tx3U-3Qmv-LDzmk';\nconst SHARED_DRIVE_ID = '0ACOEEMt4iqhgUk9PVA';\n\nconst fullPath = $input.item.json.folder_path;\n// e.g. \"/hr/brain/data/Marketing/Head_Of_Growth/Chanran_Singh/\"\n\n// Strip the prefix that's already physically created\nconst relativePath = fullPath\n  .replace('/hr/brain/data/', '')\n  .replace(/\\/$/, '');\n// e.g. \"Marketing/Head_Of_Growth/Chanran_Singh\"\n\nconst segments = relativePath.split('/').filter(s => s.length > 0);\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...$input.item.json,\n    drive_root_id: ROOT_FOLDER_ID,\n    drive_shared_drive_id: SHARED_DRIVE_ID,\n    department_segment: segments[0] || '',\n    role_segment: segments[1] || '',\n    candidate_segment: segments[2] || '',\n    all_segments: segments\n  }\n};"
